Package: promis2eq5d
Type: Package
Title: Map 'PROMIS' Profiles to 'EQ-5D' Utilities with Uncertainty
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Alessio", "Pignatelli", email = "apignat1@jh.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Predicts 'EQ-5D-5L' utilities and dimension responses from 'PROMIS-29'
    health survey profiles for any country value set in the 'eq5d' package.
    Supports mean, individual-draw and cohort-draw prediction modes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: eq5d (>= 0.17.0), splines, stats, tools, utils, withr
Suggests: glmnet, Matrix, ordinal, pbivnorm, quantreg, testthat (>= 3.2.0), xgboost
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
